{"type":"message","message":{"id":"msg_f64b83d7-e792-4058-8a73-bad5b5adee63","role":"user","created":1775323219,"content":[{"type":"toolResponse","id":"call_6bcdab44977a49cf85d1fcc5","toolResult":{"status":"success","value":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"To know when to expect your renewal notice and keep a good thing coming ... to keep subscription prices down, the Government Printing Office mails each subscriber only one renewal notice. You can learn when you will get your renewal notice by checking the number that follows ISSDUE on the top line of your label as shown in this example:\nWhen this digit is 0, a renewal notice will be sent.\nTRBU SMITH212J ISSDUE000 R 1\nJOHN SMITH\n212 MAIN ST\nFORESTVILLE MD 20747\n\nWhen that number reads ISSDUE000, you have received your last issue unless you renew. You should receive your renewal notice around the same time that you receive the issue with ISSDUE000 on the top line.\n\nTo be sure that your service continues without interruption, please return your renewal notice promptly. If your subscription service is discontinued, simply send your mailing label from any issue to the Superintendent of Documents, Washington, DC 20402-9372 with the proper remittance, and your service will be reinstated.\n\nTo change your address... please SEND YOUR MAILING LABEL, along with your new address, to the Superintendent of Documents, Attn: Chief, Mail List Branch, Mail Stop: SSOM, Washington, DC 20402-9373.\n\nTo inquire about your subscription service ... please SEND YOUR MAILING LABEL, along with your correspondence, to the Superintendent of Documents, Attn: Chief, Mail List Branch, Mail Stop: SSOM, Washington, DC 20402-9375.\n\nNew Subscribers To order a new subscription ... please use the order form provided below.\n\nSuperintendent of Documents Subscriptions Order Form\n\nOrder Processing Code\n\n*6735 YES\n\nCharge your order. It's easy!\n\nS3\n\nYES, please send me the following indicated subscriptions: subscriptions of TREASURY BULLETIN, TRBU, for $27.00 per year. subscriptions of DAILY TREASURY STATEMENT, DTS, for $174.00 per year. subscriptions of MONTHLY TREASURY STATEMENT, MTSRO, for $22.00 per year.\n\n| 0 | 1 |\n| --- | --- |\n| The total cost of my order is $_________. Prices include regular domestic postage and handling and are subject to change. International customers please add 25%. | The total cost of my order is $_________. Prices include regular domestic postage and handling and are subject to change. International customers please add 25%. |\n| (Company or personal name) (Please type or print) | Please Choose Method of Payment:  Check payable to the Superintendent of Documents  GPO Deposit Account VISA or MasterCard Account |\n| (Additional address/attention line) | nan |\n| (Street address) | (Credit card expiration date) Thank you for your order! |\n| (City, State, ZIP Code) | nan |\n| (___________) | (Signature) $8.90 |\n| (Daytime phone including area code) | nan |\n| Mail To: Superintendent of Documents, Government Printing Office, Washington, DC 20402-9371 | Mail To: Superintendent of Documents, Government Printing Office, Washington, DC 20402-9371 |\n\nForm can be photocopied\n\nFORMATION\nCI\nNSERVATION INC\n\nU.S. TREASURY LIBRARY\n\n1 0023326\n\n\n[Output exceeded 2000 line limit (5660 lines total). Full output saved to /tmp/.tmpprWeZD/output-0. Read it with shell commands like `head`, `tail`, or `sed -n '100,200p'` up to 2000 lines at a time.]","annotations":{"priority":0.0}}],"structuredContent":{"stdout":"To know when to expect your renewal notice and keep a good thing coming ... to keep subscription prices down, the Government Printing Office mails each subscriber only one renewal notice. You can learn when you will get your renewal notice by checking the number that follows ISSDUE on the top line of your label as shown in this example:\nWhen this digit is 0, a renewal notice will be sent.\nTRBU SMITH212J ISSDUE000 R 1\nJOHN SMITH\n212 MAIN ST\nFORESTVILLE MD 20747\n\nWhen that number reads ISSDUE000, you have received your last issue unless you renew. You should receive your renewal notice around the same time that you receive the issue with ISSDUE000 on the top line.\n\nTo be sure that your service continues without interruption, please return your renewal notice promptly. If your subscription service is discontinued, simply send your mailing label from any issue to the Superintendent of Documents, Washington, DC 20402-9372 with the proper remittance, and your service will be reinstated.\n\nTo change your address... please SEND YOUR MAILING LABEL, along with your new address, to the Superintendent of Documents, Attn: Chief, Mail List Branch, Mail Stop: SSOM, Washington, DC 20402-9373.\n\nTo inquire about your subscription service ... please SEND YOUR MAILING LABEL, along with your correspondence, to the Superintendent of Documents, Attn: Chief, Mail List Branch, Mail Stop: SSOM, Washington, DC 20402-9375.\n\nNew Subscribers To order a new subscription ... please use the order form provided below.\n\nSuperintendent of Documents Subscriptions Order Form\n\nOrder Processing Code\n\n*6735 YES\n\nCharge your order. It's easy!\n\nS3\n\nYES, please send me the following indicated subscriptions: subscriptions of TREASURY BULLETIN, TRBU, for $27.00 per year. subscriptions of DAILY TREASURY STATEMENT, DTS, for $174.00 per year. subscriptions of MONTHLY TREASURY STATEMENT, MTSRO, for $22.00 per year.\n\n| 0 | 1 |\n| --- | --- |\n| The total cost of my order is $_________. Prices include regular domestic postage and handling and are subject to change. International customers please add 25%. | The total cost of my order is $_________. Prices include regular domestic postage and handling and are subject to change. International customers please add 25%. |\n| (Company or personal name) (Please type or print) | Please Choose Method of Payment:  Check payable to the Superintendent of Documents  GPO Deposit Account VISA or MasterCard