0.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [228, 1307, 1402, 1465], \"page_id\": 6}], \"content\": \"United States Government Annual Report and Appendix. Annual Report presents budgetary results at the summary level. Appendix presents the individual receipt and appropriation accounts at the detail level. Annual Report single copy price: $2; Appendix free from Financial Management Service.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [138, 1589, 864, 1634], \"page_id\": 6}], \"content\": \"\\u2020 Subscription order form on inside back cover of this issue.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [145, 1808, 694, 1837], \"page_id\": 6}], \"content\": \"ON THE COVER: A line drawing from an old photograph of\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1839, 742, 1866], \"page_id\": 6}], \"content\": \"Treasury's West Portico, looking toward the Washington Monument.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [70, 29, 1327, 1643], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": null, \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"figure\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [152, 1674, 1272, 1715], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": \"Office of the Secretary \\u2022 Department of the Treasury \\u2022 Washington, D.C.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [352, 1871, 1075, 1920], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": \"The Treasury Bulletin is for sale by the Superintendent of Documents, U.S. Government Printing Office, Washington, D.C. 20402\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [634, 139, 885, 192], \"page_id\": 9}], \"content\": \"Contents\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1002, 291, 1434, 313], \"page_id\": 9}], \"content\": \"SUMMER ISSUE, SEPTEMBER 19